  first | exact @GlobalTheory.ChF.embeddings_idempotents_conjugation | exact GlobalTheory.ChF.embeddings_idempotents_conjugation | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.ChF.embeddings_idempotents_conjugation <;> assumption)
